From: Lay Patel <laypatel.lp103@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 04:57:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Order history: change prices and delete orders
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Edit order: a price box on every line (₹ each, add-ons included); the bill, money book,
  reports and the guest's spend follow
- Delete order (with a reason): the order stays in Order history, tinted light red and marked
  Deleted, but leaves the money book, reports, live board and the guest's visits; its bill is
  voided, or reduced when the bill has other orders
- Both sit behind Settings → Editing → "Add and edit orders" (owner only)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CESPNZ2mDnZSVm9srcJgyq
